    [BugFix][Ascend] Unify MegaMoe config checks across A3 and A5 (v0.32.0rc backport) (#20506)
    
    Backport of #20430 to the `releases/v0.32.0rc` branch.
    
    Cherry-picked commits (clean, no conflicts):
    - 116eda353 [BugFix][Ascend] Unify MegaMoe config checks across A3 and
    A5
    - cb4bff1af [BugFix][Ascend] Remove shadowed HardwareCapability imports
    flagged by ruff
    - 6afd7412a [BugFix][Ascend] Guard MegaMoe config check against None
    model_config, dense models, and null num_top_k
    - 3838a6e5a [BugFix][Ascend] Align MegaMoe config-check UTs with unified
    validation rules
    - ebfbf445e [BugFix][Ascend] Drop K3-only routed_expert_hidden_size from
    legacy A5 UT fixture
    
    Verified the cherry-picked `vllm_ascend/ascend_config.py` and
    `tests/ut/test_ascend_config.py` are byte-identical to the main PR
    branch, and ruff passes.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
